<title>ESTONIA: NEW EQUITY ISSUES.</title>
<headline>NEW EQUITY ISSUES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following timetable of new</p>
<p>equity issues for 1997 is tentative and subject to change.</p>
<p>To include or update items please phone the Tallinn newsroom</p>
<p>on +372 620 9202/1 or email to reuters@reuters.ee.</p>
<p>New entries or amendments are marked with *. All amounts are</p>
<p>in kroons.</p>
<p>***INITIAL PUBLIC OFFERINGS AND NEW ISSUES***</p>
<p> COMPANY						SUBSCRIPTION</p>
<p> FACE VALUE  ISSUE SIZE  PRICE    MANAGER	    PERIOD</p>
<p>  Kuutsemae ski resort				     New issue</p>
<p>  10.00	184,000     22.00			   Aug 11-25</p>
<p>  Koger and Sumberg, construction company	    New issue</p>
<p>  10.00	375,040     60.00  Hansa Investments  Aug 15-Sept 1</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
